// Every piece of authored CONTENT in this mission lives in this one file. story.mast holds
// only the logic that reacts to it.
//
// The shape is a table of contents: one `#` root, a `##` section per loader, and `###` /
// `####` records inside. story.mast parses this once and hands each section to its loader.
//
// A record is `### [Display Name](key)`, an optional `---` fenced block of fields, then
// body prose. Comments are `//` - note that .mast uses `#` instead.

# [Sample Mission](sample_mission)


// ---- Quests. Nested records are steps of the arc above them, addressed `arc/step`.
## [Quests](quests)

### [First Contact](first_contact)
---
Arc
Scope: shared
Starts when: at once
---
A derelict has drifted into the sector. Find out what happened to it.

#### [Find the Derelict](find)
---
Scope: shared
Starts when: at once
Done when: signal derelict_found
Then: reveal first_contact/study
---
Fly out and locate the drifting hulk.

#### [Study the Derelict](study)
---
Scope: shared
Starts when: revealed
Done when: signal derelict_scanned
---
Science should take a full scan of the hull.

### [Close Inspection](approach)
---
Scope: shared
Starts when: at once
Objective: Close to within 500 of the hulk
Done when: reach derelict 500
Then: signal board_hulk
Reward: 100 credits
---
The hulk is not answering hails. Bring the ship in close and take a look.

### [Account for the Crew](account)
---
Scope: shared
Starts when: at once
Objective: Find out who was aboard the hulk
Done when: signal names_known
Reward: 150 credits
---
Somebody crewed that ship. Command wants names.


// ---- Science scans. `Scan of:` names a ROLE, so one record covers every object wearing
// it. `Tab:` picks which science tab the text lands in, and each `%` line is one of
// several readings picked at random - so a second scan does not read identically.
## [Scans](scans)

### [Derelict Hull](derelict_scan)
---
Scan of: derelict
Tab: scan
---
% The hull is cold. Whatever happened here happened a long time ago.
% Hull plating is intact but every port is dark. No power anywhere aboard.

### [Derelict Materials](derelict_mat)
---
Scan of: derelict
Tab: mat
---
% Scoring along the plating matches no weapon in use in this sector.


