## [Scenes](boarding)

### [The Airlock](airlock)
% The outer door was never sealed. Frost on the inside of the glass, and a row of suits still on their hooks.

- [Read the name tags on the suits](suits) if medical ; learn suits, signal names_read
- [Go aft, toward the reactor](reactor)
- [Go forward, to the bridge](bridge)
- [Return to the ship]()

### [Six Suits](suits)
% Six suits, six names, and every one of them is here. Nobody left this ship through the airlock.

- [Step back](airlock)

### [The Reactor Room](reactor)
% Cold. The core was shut down by hand, in the right order, by someone who had time.

- [Read the shutdown record](shutdown) if engineering ; learn shutdown, signal core_read
- [Try to wake the core](core_wakes) ; check engineering 9 else core_dead, learn lockout
- [Go back to the airlock](airlock)

### [The Shutdown Record](shutdown)
% Shut down from this room, and then the restart key was taken out and carried away. Whoever did it did not mean for her to wake up.

- [Step back](reactor)

### [The Core Turns Over](core_wakes)
% The board lights for four seconds. Long enough to read one line: MANUAL LOCKOUT, CAPTAIN'S KEY.

- [Step back](reactor)

### [The Board Stays Dark](core_dead)
% Nothing. Not a flicker. Whatever you tried, the core did not notice.

- [Step back](reactor)

### [The Bridge](bridge)
%{learned < 2} Every station is dark but one. The log is open on the captain's chair, locked behind a question you cannot answer yet.
%{learned >= 2} Every station is dark but one. The log is open on the captain's chair, and now you know what it is going to ask.

- [Answer the log](last_entry) if learned >= 2
- [Pull the sensor record](sensor_record) if skill science >= 3 ; learn sensors
- [Go back to the airlock](airlock)

### [The Sensor Record](sensor_record)
% One contact, closing, eleven days before the core went cold. It never arrived. It is still out there.

- [Step back](bridge)

### [The Last Entry](last_entry)
% Six aboard. Core cold. Key over the side. The last entry is one word: QUARANTINE.

- [Return to the ship]()


